/**
 * Turn security on.
 *
 * Production level enforces the access rules on every read and write. The
 * platform's demo users are switched off — the app seeds real accounts for the
 * nine fee earners plus a practice-management account, so signing in as
 * somebody is the same thing as being them.
 */
alter project security level production;
/
alter project security demo users off;
/
